      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CORLESS SERIOUS (2) was in the placings last time but prior to that she produced a head turning 22.68 win over 401m at this track. Hot win two back and looks the one to beat here. SPRING COSMIC (6) goes very well at the distance with two wins and a placing from six starts. Below best last time at Goulburn (25.31) in a Grade 5, finishing a 5.5 lengths fourth. Can feature in the finish. GYPSY SUNRISE (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (18.52) at this track behind Fliegen in a Grade 5. Spotted a start but got home hard. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Expected to feature again. SPRING VELVET (3) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
